1
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,541
Let's talk tomorrow, Dad.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,671
Tomorrow, Dad.

3
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,631
I had always said tomorrow.

4
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,151
We thought there would always be another morning.

5
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:49,231
We kept postponing the moments that mattered, believing time would wait for us.

6
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:53,791
But life does not promise us another tomorrow.

7
00:00:53,900 --> 00:01:02,971
Sometimes, we don't realize how precious an ordinary moment is until it becomes a memory.

8
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:06,851
So love while you can.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:11,471
Listen while they can speak.

10
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:16,871
Sit with them while they are still beside you.

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:21,391
Because not every tomorrow is promised.
